{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And he begot Enoch.</b> He was seventh, and was inaugurated to holiness, for we find that the seventh is holy. And so it is written of David — ״he was the seventh״ — this thing brought him to holiness. And so we find: of seven heavens — Aravot; of seven lands — the land of Israel; of seven deserts — the desert of Sinai; of seven seas — the Sea of Kinneret; of seven worlds — the seventh world, which is entirely Shabbat; of seven lamps — the western lamp; of seven days — the seventh day; and likewise Tishrei, Shemittah, and Jubilee."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:06.635229738Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}